(Train the passage selector\073 keep the reader frozen) Tj
T*
(The language model predicts the next words\054 and a separate model\054 the reranker\054 chooses which passage to give it\056) Tj
T*
(To train the reranker\054 they take a text and its true continuation\056) Tj
T*
(A passage is good if it makes the continuation more likely\056) Tj
T*
(They fine\055tune a RoBERTa model on that signal) Tj
T*
(At test time\054 the reranker scores the retrieved candidates\054 they select its top choice) Tj
T*
(They train the passage selector and keep the language model unchanged\056) Tj
T*
