T*
(Training) Tj
T*
(During training\054 they know the target answer and score it token by token while feeding the correct prefix) Tj
T*
(that loss updates the query encoder and generator\056) Tj
T*
(Answering) Tj
T*
(For a new question\054 they have no target) Tj
T*
(it retrieves passages and generates from what it has produced so far\054 without updating for that question\056) Tj
T*
(DPR was trained earlier with question\226passage pairs\056) Tj
