(Entropy measures how spread out those probabilities are\056) Tj
T*
(Max Entropy takes the largest such entropy in the preliminary answer\056) Tj
T*
(To fit a gate\054 generate training answers without retrieval and pair their scores with whether they contain a benchmark reference answer\056) Tj
T*
(A classifier learns to predict answer success from this one score\073 the answering model stays fixed\056) Tj
T*
