1.2 TL
(When sources disagree) Tj
T*
(Imagine three websites\054 all relevant\054 all answering differently\056 Similarity won\222t tell us which is correct\056) Tj
T*
(That\222s where Reliability\055Aware RAG comes in\056 It estimates each source\222s track record before answering new questions\056) Tj
T*
(It asks a set of checking questions\054 compares how sources answer\054 and uses agreement patterns to estimate reliability\056) Tj
T*
(Then\054 for a new question\054 it weighs sources by those estimates\054 still searching for relevance\054 but no longer treating every source as equally trustworthy\056) Tj
T*
(Retrieval\055Augmented Generation with Estimation of Source Reliability) Tj
T*
(Jeongyeon Hwang et al\056 \267 EMNLP 2025) Tj
T*
(RA\055RAG means Reliability\055Aware RAG\056) Tj
T*
T*
ET

Q

