(If all the cited passages together do not support the whole sentence\054 every citation on that sentence receives zero\056) Tj
T*
(Otherwise\054 a citation earns credit if it supports the sentence by itself\054 or if removing it leaves the sentence unsupported\056 Two passages that each fully support the sentence can both count\056) Tj
