(What does each row do\077) Tj
T*
(Fluency \050MAUVE\051 compares generated and human\055written text\056 Correctness \050EM recall\051 measures the fraction of expected short answers included\056) Tj
T*
(Vanilla\072 The model writes from five full passages\056) Tj
T*
(w\057 Rerank\072 Generate four full answers and keep the one with the highest automatic citation recall\056) Tj
T*
(SUMM\072 The model writes from LLM\055written summaries of ten passages\056) Tj
T*
(w\057 INTERACT\072 Start with summaries\054 then let the model open full passages while writing\056) Tj
T*
(SNIPPET\072 The model writes from copied excerpts of ten passages\056) Tj
T*
(INLINESEARCH\072 While writing\054 the model searches within the 100 retrieved passages\056) Tj
T*
(CLOSED BOOK\072 Write without passages\054 then attach each sentence\222s best\055matching passage from the 100 retrieved passages\056) Tj
T*
