(Does summarization show the same pattern\077) Tj
T*
(Multi\055document summarization turns several news articles into one summary\056) Tj
T*
(AIS credits sentence attribution from 0 to 100\073 time is seconds per text check\073 fluency rates coherent writing from 1 to 5\056) Tj
T*
(Does easier checking still come with stronger support\077) Tj
T*
(The summaries take less time to check\054 from 47 to 22 seconds per text\056) Tj
T*
(But AIS falls from 89\0563 to 79\0569\054 even as fluency rises from 4\0567 to 4\0569\056) Tj
T*
(The summaries are easier to check and read\054 but their citations receive less attribution credit\056) Tj
